<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{% block title %}Flamengo News{% endblock %}</title>
<meta name="description" content="Newsletter do Flamengo: notícias resumidas, análise do último jogo, próximo jogo e tabela. Toda segunda e sexta, às 8h.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Flamengo News">
<meta property="og:description" content="As notícias do Mengão na sua caixa de entrada, toda segunda e sexta às 8h.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:url" content="{{ public_url }}/">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://a.espncdn.com/i/teamlogos/soccer/500/819.png">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#000000">
<link rel="icon" href="https://a.espncdn.com/i/teamlogos/soccer/500/819.png">
<style>
  :root {
    --red: #C3281E;
    --red-dark: #9E1F17;
    --ink: #111111;
    --text: #222222;
    --muted: #666666;
    --line: #e6e6e6;
    --paper: #ffffff;
    --bg: #ececec;
    --black: #000000;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  a { color: var(--red); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .header { background: var(--black); }
  .header-inner, .main, .footer-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }
  .header-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding-top: 18px; padding-bottom: 18px; }
  .header img { width: 44px; height: 44px; }
  .brand { color: #fff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0; }
  .brand span { color: var(--red); }
  .brand-link:hover { text-decoration: none; }
  .tagline { color: #bbbbbb; font-size: 13px; margin: 2px 0 0; }
  .stripe { background: var(--red); height: 5px; }
  .card { background: var(--paper); margin: 24px 0; padding: 28px 24px; }
  h1 { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--black); }
  h2 { color: var(--red); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--text); }
  .lead { font-size: 17px; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  form.signup { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin: 20px 0 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  input[type=email] {
    flex: 1 1 240px; min-width: 0; font: inherit; font-size: 16px;
    padding: 12px 14px; border: 2px solid var(--black); border-radius: 0;
  }
  input[type=email]:focus { outline: 3px solid var(--red); outline-offset: 0; }
  button {
    font: inherit; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .5px; cursor: pointer;
    background: var(--red); color: #fff; border: 0; padding: 12px 22px;
  }
  button:hover { background: var(--red-dark); }
  button.secondary { background: var(--black); }
  .error { color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .hp { position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .item { border-left: 4px solid var(--red); background: #fafafa; padding: 14px 16px; }
  .item strong { display: block; color: var(--black); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .item p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; }
  .scoreboard { background: var(--black); color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 18px 12px 14px; }
  .teams { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: center; }
  .team img { width: 56px; height: 56px; }
  .team div { font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .score { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; }
  .score .x { color: var(--red); font-size: 20px; }
  .match-info { color: #bbbbbb; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .sample-caption { margin-top: 8px; }
  .footer-inner { color: #777777; font-size: 12px; padding-bottom: 32px; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    h1 { font-size: 25px; }
    .card { padding: 22px 16px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    button { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="header">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <img src="https://a.espncdn.com/i/teamlogos/soccer/500/819.png" alt="" width="44" height="44">
    <div>
      <a class="brand-link" href="/"><p class="brand">FLAMENGO <span>NEWS</span></p></a>
      <p class="tagline">Segunda e sexta, às 8h, no seu e-mail</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="stripe"></div>
<main class="main">
{% block content %}{% endblock %}
</main>
<footer class="footer-inner">
  Projeto pessoal de um torcedor, sem fins comerciais e sem ligação oficial com o clube.
  Resumos gerados com IA a partir das fontes citadas em cada edição; escudos e dados: ESPN.
  Código aberto no <a href="https://github.com/dpontejs/flamengo-news">GitHub</a>.
</footer>
</body>
</html>
